# NATALIA — active local-first edition
#
# No environment variables are required for the current product.
# Wardrobe data stays in the browser's localStorage and the application does
# not connect to Supabase, Stripe, Anthropic, ElevenLabs, SMTP, S3 or analytics.
#
# Add provider-specific variables only when the corresponding integration is
# actually implemented, documented and protected by its own data/privacy
# contract. Never commit real credentials.
